[Name] libdisplay-info
[Summary] EDID/DisplayID parser library
[Description] libdisplay-info parses EDID and DisplayID descriptors from monitors; replaced libdrm's edid parser in Mutter. Required by Mutter 48+ (>= 0.2). Build AFTER GLib 2.84 and BEFORE Mutter. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
